  "paragraphs": {
    "This report goes to the Pi developers (Earendil) and is not shared publicly. It includes your pi version, operating system, the current model and provider configuration (without API keys), loaded extensions, settings, and provider error diagnostics from this session.": "这份报告会发送给 Pi 开发者（Earendil），不会公开分享。报告包含你的 Pi 版本、操作系统、当前模型与提供方配置（不含 API 密钥）、已加载的扩展、设置，以及本次会话的提供方错误诊断信息。",
    "The transcript contains your messages, model output, tool calls and their results, including file contents and command output read during this session.": "会话记录包含你的消息、模型输出、工具调用及其结果——包括本次会话读取过的文件内容与命令输出。",
    "Opting in stores a tracking identifier in settings.json and enables anonymous usage analytics. This helps us to better debug, reproduce, and resolve issues and bugs within Pi. You can observe what is shared using /privacy and make changes anytime in settings.json.": "选择开启后会在 settings.json 里保存一个追踪标识，并开启匿名使用统计。这有助于我们更好地调试、复现和修复 Pi 中的问题。你可以用 /privacy 查看共享了什么，也可随时在 settings.json 中更改。"
  },
